{"item_uid": "學測84-science-050", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 50, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "土星與太陽的距離約是地球與太陽距離的10 倍，其半徑亦約為地球半徑的10\n倍，土星所接受的日光能約是地球的多少倍？", "options": {"A": "1/10000", "B": "1/10", "C": "l", "D": "10", "E": "10000"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-051", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 51, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "三個人在操場上談話，小英的聲音又尖又高，小強的聲音宏亮大聲，小雯說\n話又快又急。這些聲音在空氣中散播開來，何者傳得最快？", "options": {"A": "小英的聲音傳得最快", "B": "小強的聲音傳得最快", "C": "小雯的聲音傳得最快", "D": "三人的聲音傳得一樣快"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-052", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 52, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "鋼琴中央C的頻率為262Hz；若以此為「ㄉㄡ」，則「ㄌㄚ」的頻率為440Hz ，\n下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "「ㄌㄚ」的波長較「ㄉㄡ」為短", "B": "一樣的琴弦，張力相同時，發出「ㄉㄡ」的弦要比發出「ㄌㄚ」的弦為短", "C": "原本發出「ㄉㄡ」的琴弦，若彈得快一點，可以使琴音頻率增高", "D": "高八度的「ㄉㄡ」頻率是880Hz"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-053", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 53, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關空氣中聲波的敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "超聲波的波速超快", "B": "頻率愈高的聲波，聲音強度愈強", "C": "波峰與波谷之間的距離稱為波長", "D": "振幅愈大，聲音強度愈強"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-054", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 54, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "廚房裡有電鍋(110V，1000W)、電燈(110V，100W)、電視(110V，200W)。如\n果把三個電器並聯，而且同時使用，則下列敘述何者錯誤？", "options": {"A": "需要電源電壓為（110+110+110 ）伏特", "B": "總消耗功率為（1000+100+200）瓦特", "C": "總供應電流為（1000/110）＋（100/110）＋（200/110）安培", "D": "三個電器同時使用的總電阻，比任何單獨使用時的電阻要小"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-055", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 55, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關幾位科學家重要研究發現的敘述，何者錯誤 ？", "options": {"A": "發現一連串銅片與鋅片夾潮濕硬紙板，可以產生長時間穩定電流的是伏打", "B": "發現直導線通電流時會使附近磁針偏轉的是庫侖", "C": "發現一般金屬導線兩端電壓與通過電流成正比關係的是歐姆", "D": "發現磁場的變動會產生電流的是法拉第\n-10-\n第 11 頁 自然考科\n共 13 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-056", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 56, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「打開汽水瓶蓋，先有少許氣體逸出，按著又有大量氣泡從汽水中冒出，因\n此汽水溫度略為下降」。上述現象詮釋下列事實中的那一項？", "options": {"A": "水變為水蒸氣時，吸收熱量", "B": "該氣體的溶解度與壓力有關；壓力愈大，溶得愈多", "C": "水在低壓之下，沸點下降", "D": "該氣體是二氧化碳"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-057", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 57, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "電廠所發的電，先用變壓器把電壓升高，輸送到遠方；送到用戶附近時，再\n用變壓器把電壓降低，然後才送給各用戶。有關變壓器調節電壓的原理，下\n列敘述何項錯誤？", "options": {"A": "為了便於改變電壓，輸出及輸入的電流為交流電", "B": "電流有磁效應", "C": "磁通量的變化產生感應電動勢", "D": "變壓器將電壓降低時，因電壓下降會損失許多電能"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-058", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 58, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關原子構造的敘述，何者正確？\n甲：原子的質量均勻分布於整個原子之中\n乙：原子的質量絕大部分集中在原子核\n丙：電子和質子的數目一定相等\n丁：質子和中子的數目一定相等", "options": {"A": "甲丙", "B": "甲丁", "C": "乙丙", "D": "乙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-059", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 59, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如果以原子為組成物質的單元，則直徑為0.1毫米的一粒細砂含有的原子數目\n約為多少？(選最接近的數量級)", "options": {"A": "106", "B": "109", "C": "1013", "D": "1017"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-060", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 60, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "核電廠以鈾235為燃料，以慢中子促使其分裂，利用這種核分裂反應所釋出的\n能量來發電。有關反應事件的敘述，何項錯誤 ？", "options": {"A": "原子經過核分裂反應，反應前後的原子種類改變了", "B": "有的反應生成物，帶有很強的輻射性", "C": "比起煤或石油來，核燃料只以很少的質量就可產生很大的能量", "D": "這種反應生成物的輻射性，經過低溫冷凍處理即可清除\n請注意：\n第61題至第80題，未安排試題。請從第81題繼續作答。\n-11-\n自然考科 第 12 頁\n共 13 頁\n貳、題群題\n說明：第81至87題。答案標示在答案卡之「選擇題(第二部分)」。每\n題完全答對得2分，若有兩個正確選項，只答對一個不給分，\n答錯不倒扣。"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-061", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 81, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "控制人類捲舌性狀的基因是那一類物質？\n它是存在於右側細胞示意圖( 圖19)中的那\n一構造內？\n(由A-D與 E-J中各選一個)", "options": {"A": "醣類", "E": "甲", "B": "核酸", "F": "乙", "C": "脂肪酸", "G": "丙", "D": "蛋白質", "H": "丁", "I": "戊", "J": "己 圖19"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-science-062", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 82, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下面共有七個參數，若要以最簡單的計算求得亞佛加厥常數，應使用那兩個\n參數？", "options": {"A": "氣體常數 R=O.082大氣壓．升/莫耳．K", "B": "氣體莫耳體積 V=22.4升(STP)", "C": "電子電荷 e=l.60×10−19庫侖", "D": "電子質量 m e =9.1×10−31公斤", "E": "重力常數 G=6.67x10−11牛頓．公尺 2/公斤 2", "F": "法拉第常數 F=96500庫侖", "G": "浦朗克常數 h=6.62x10−34焦耳．秒\n-12-\n第 13 頁 自然考科\n共 13 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
